PN,41701
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,FCivil servants have received threats
OL,7,Fand abuse following controversy over
OL,8,Fthe shooting of 51 cattle in Co
OL,9,FTyrone, Agriculture Minister Andrew
OL,10,FMuir has said.
OL,12,FProviding an update to MLAs, Mr Muir
OL,13,Fsaid that "no animal was chased around
OL,14,Ffields" by staff and no cattle were
OL,15,Fshot multiple times.
OL,26,@uD@KOUvD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/18
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,FHe did, however, state that some
OL,7,Fanimals had made it onto a public road
OL,8,Fand had been chased "for a significant
OL,9,Fperiod of time" after a local farmer
OL,10,Fhad expressed interest in buying some
OL,11,Fof the cows.
OL,13,FMr Muir ordered an external review of
OL,14,Fthe cull on Monday.
OL,16,FThe incident was carried out by the
OL,17,FDepartment of Agriculture, Environment
OL,18,Fand Rural Affairs' (DAERA) Humane
OL,19,FSlaughter Team on land near
OL,20,FFivemiletown at the end of June.
OL,26,@pD@UOUqD@OO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/18
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,FThe cattle were culled because the
OL,7,Ffarmer that owned them was convicted
OL,8,Fof numerous animal welfare offences
OL,9,Fand a court banned him from keeping or
OL,10,Fowning animals for life.
OL,12,FHowever, it caused a lot of anger and
OL,13,Fconcerns have been raised about the
OL,14,Fpublic nature of the incident.
OL,16,FThe Ulster Farmers Union (UFU) and
OL,17,Fpolitical representatives have said
OL,18,Fthey had concerns about the way it was
OL,19,Fcarried out.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/18
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,FOn Thursday Mr Muir gave an update
OL,7,Fthrough an Urgent Written Statement to
OL,8,Fthe Assembly.
OL,10,FHe said it arose following a court
OL,11,Forder requiring the department to act
OL,12,Fafter a man was convicted of a number
OL,13,Fof offences and disqualified for life
OL,14,Ffrom keeping animals.
OL,16,FThe minister said the department gave
OL,17,Fthe herd keeper three weeks to sell
OL,18,Foff or dispose of his animals, but he
OL,19,F"only divested himself of a small
OL,20,Fnumber of animals".
OL,26,@{D@AOU|D@RO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/18
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,FHe said this left 51 cows on the land
OL,7,Fwhich had to be removed from the
OL,8,Fdisqualified keeper.
OL,10,FMr Muir said: "The department was
OL,11,Funfortunately left with no reasonable
OL,12,Falternative to comply with the court
OL,13,Forder, other than to euthanise the
OL,14,Fanimals.
OL,26,@rD@OOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/18
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,F"While it is generally preferable for
OL,7,Fthe animals to be removed from the
OL,8,Fpremises and euthanised remotely, in
OL,9,Fcertain circumstances, such as this
OL,10,Fcase, it was the assessment of
OL,11,Fprofessional veterinary staff that
OL,12,Fthis option was simply not possible."
OL,14,FHe said officials had decided the
OL,15,Fanimals could not be moved to a
OL,16,Fdifferent location.
OL,18,FHe said that 50 cattle were
OL,19,F"euthanised" on June 29 and another
OL,20,Fone the following day.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@eO]{D@AOU{D@LO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/18
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,FThe minister said: "The staff in this
OL,7,Fteam are highly trained, in line with
OL,8,Fbest practice and legislative
OL,9,Frequirements, and highly respected
OL,10,Facross these islands for their
OL,11,Fexpertise following procedures that
OL,12,Fprovide for a humane death."
OL,14,FMr Muir said he had been "alarmed by
OL,15,Fsome of the highly inaccurate and
OL,16,Firresponsible commentary surrounding
OL,17,Fthe team's actions".
OL,26,@nD@TOUtD@\O]vD@ZOUyD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/18
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,FHe said: "Officials have outlined that
OL,7,Fno animal was chased around fields by
OL,8,FDaera staff, no animal was shot
OL,9,Fmultiple times, nor were there sounds
OL,10,Fof loud gunfire.
OL,12,F"It is standard practice that
OL,13,Fsilencers are used, an important
OL,14,Fdetail both from an animal welfare and
OL,15,Ffrom a public concern perspective."
OL,17,FMr Muir said the the animals were
OL,18,F"collected and disposed of the next
OL,19,Fmorning" with efforts made to keep
OL,20,Fthis operation out of public view.
OL,26,@nD@JOUtD@AOUwD@cO]zD@AOU{D@HO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/18
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41709
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,FThe minister added: "Two of the sites
OL,7,Fwere very remote with limited public
OL,8,Faccess and the cattle were euthanised
OL,9,Fon these sites by approximately 1.30pm
OL,10,Fon June 29 with no issues arising.
OL,12,F"On the third site, I understand that
OL,13,Fissues did arise when a local farmer
OL,14,Fapproached staff at the scene to
OL,15,Findicate a potential interest in
OL,16,Fpurchasing some of the animals."
OL,18,FMr Muir said operations were "halted
OL,19,Fimmediately to provide space for any
OL,20,Ftransaction to take place".
OL,26,@nD@UOUtD@AOUxD@`O]zD@^OU|D@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G9/18
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41710
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,FHe told MLAs: "The local farmer
OL,7,Fseeking to purchase some of the
OL,8,Fanimals, another individual and the
OL,9,Fherd keeper were facilitated to remove
OL,10,Fthe animals from a field into a lorry.
OL,12,F"They chased the animals for a
OL,13,Fsignificant period of time and
OL,14,Freleased them onto a public road which
OL,15,Fcreated further health and safety
OL,16,Frisks.
OL,26,@nD@OOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G10/18
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41711
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,F"While those actions delayed the
OL,7,Fcompletion of operations, ultimately
OL,8,FDaera staff had to intervene as the
OL,9,Findividuals were unable to detain the
OL,10,Fanimals which by that stage were
OL,11,Fstressed."
OL,13,FMr Muir said by this point there was a
OL,14,F"small number of protesters at the
OL,15,Fsite" but operations did not
OL,16,Frecommence until they had left the
OL,17,Fscene.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@JO]vD@AOUwD@EO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G11/18
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41712
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,FHe added: "With the assistance of some
OL,7,Fneighbouring farmers, staff were able
OL,8,Fto move the remaining cattle from the
OL,9,Froad and they were subsequently
OL,10,Feuthanised."
OL,12,FThe minister said there had been
OL,13,F"highly irresponsible and very
OL,14,Fmisleading" political and public
OL,15,Fcommentary about the cull.
OL,26,@nD@KOUrD@LO]uD@AOUvD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G12/18
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41713
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,FHe said: "Other commentary,
OL,7,Fparticularly on social media, has had
OL,8,Fthe effect of encouraging and
OL,9,Fprovoking quite disgraceful and
OL,10,Funacceptable reactions, including some
OL,11,Fthat are abusive and clearly
OL,12,Fmisogynistic.
OL,14,F"That commentary has led to threats
OL,15,Fbeing made against some Daera staff
OL,16,Fand multiple other staff being
OL,17,Fsubjected to significant abuse online,
OL,18,Fin person and through written
OL,19,Fcorrespondence.
OL,26,@nD@JOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G13/18
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41714
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,F"That is not acceptable in any
OL,7,Fscenario, and certainly not when it
OL,8,Fcomes to our civil and public servants
OL,9,Fcarrying out their lawful duties.
OL,11,F"My senior officials now have to
OL,12,Freview risk assessments, reassure
OL,13,Fstaff as to the value and importance
OL,14,Fof their work, and assess what
OL,15,Fspecific security, policing or legal
OL,16,Fresponses are required in the case of
OL,17,Fsome comments."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUyD@OO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G14/18
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41715
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,FResponding to the ministerial
OL,7,Fstatement, Agriculture Committee
OL,8,Fchairman and Ulster Unionist MLA
OL,9,FRobbie Butler said a "central question
OL,10,Fis whether every alternative to
OL,11,Feuthanasia was genuinely exhausted".
OL,13,FHe said: "The statement records that
OL,14,Fthe keeper divested himself of some
OL,15,Fanimals during the three-week period,
OL,16,Fand that on the day of the operation a
OL,17,Flocal farmer approached staff
OL,18,Findicating an interest in purchasing
OL,19,Fanimals.
OL,26,@qD@VOUsD@cO]uD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G15/18
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41716
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,F"If sale or transfer was possible for
OL,7,Fsome of the herd, farmers will want to
OL,8,Funderstand precisely why it was judged
OL,9,Fimpossible for the remaining 51, and
OL,10,Fat what point that judgment became
OL,11,Ffinal."
OL,13,FMr Butler added: "Let me be clear
OL,14,Fabout the treatment of departmental
OL,15,Fstaff.
OL,17,F"The threats, online abuse and
OL,18,Fmisogynistic commentary directed at
OL,19,FDaera officials and veterinary staff
OL,20,Fare indefensible, and anyone
OL,21,Famplifying such material should stop.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@GO]uD@ROUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G16/18
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41717
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,F"Legitimate scrutiny and abuse are not
OL,7,Fthe same thing, and neither should be
OL,8,Fused to excuse the other.
OL,10,FDUP MLA Deborah Erskine said Mr Muir's
OL,11,Fstatement leaves "important questions
OL,12,Funanswered".
OL,14,FShe said: "This information should not
OL,15,Fhave come through a drip feed of
OL,16,Fstatements and media reports over the
OL,17,Fpast number of weeks. Given the level
OL,18,Fof public concern, the minister should
OL,19,Fhave been far more forthcoming from
OL,20,Fthe outset."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@ROUtD@KO]vD@KOU|D@LO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G17/18
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41718
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786110488
OL,3,C'No reasonable alternative' than to
OL,4,Ceuthanise cattle in Fivemiletown
OL,6,FMs Erskine added: "The statement fails
OL,7,Fagain today to apologise to
OL,8,Fconstituents that witnessed this
OL,9,Fincident occur and are genuinely
OL,10,Fconcerned by what happened in a quiet
OL,11,Frural area.
OL,13,F"That should be at the very least
OL,14,Fsomething that could and should be
OL,15,Foffered at this stage."
OL,17,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,18,FITVX
